                <pb facs="0729" n="713" sameAs="frus:frus1949v06/pg713"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>The White House, on January 31, released statements announcing as of that date
                    the <hi rendition="#italic">de jure</hi> recognition by the United States
                    Government of the Governments of Transjordan and of Israel; for the texts of the
                    statements, see Department of State <hi rendition="#italic">Bulletin</hi>,
                    February 6, 1949, page 205.</p>
                <p>The Department of State sent appropriate telegrams to Amman (No. 16) and to Tel
                    Aviv (No. 55) the same day (867N.01/1–3149).</p>
            </div>
        </body>
